From: Peng Yusheng <jiusi0519@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:48:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] fix(protocol): harden discovery and reliable delivery

Reject malformed remote QoS before discovery state is committed and make
endpoint snapshots include QoS, birth and epoch. Fence stale epochs before
reassembly or delivery, bound fragment/reorder state, and keep reliable
late-join recovery causal across clock skew.

Extend UDP and DSoftBus fake-runtime coverage for raw ANNOUNCE validation,
reliability recovery, resource limits and transport behavior.
