+// Test-only board helper for GW-11.  It is deliberately a raw MDDS reader,
+// rather than an RMW node: its only fault injection is ParticipantConfig's
+// documented test_send_hook, which drops ACKNACK frames after the reader has
+// accepted data.  This lets the real gateway Writer reach its own KEEP_ALL
+// limit while retaining every sample for retransmission.  It is not installed
+// and is never linked into libmdds or mdds_gateway.
